            "notes": "The deck focuses on utilizing the graveyard as a resource and quickly bringing out threats to overwhelm the opponent. By using creatures like Vengevine, Tarmogoyf, and Hogaak, along with cards like Reanimate and Living Death, the deck can quickly establish a strong board presence. Grist, The Hunger Tide allows for constant recursion of creatures, while cards like Survival of the Fittest and Birthing Pod provide additional tutoring and synergy. The deck also includes disruptive elements like Thoughtseize and Contamination to disrupt the opponent's game plan. Overall, the key strategy revolves around aggressive plays, graveyard manipulation, and efficient creature recursion to pressure the opponent and secure victory."
